From d2785213cb85a6b88f9ff278f7bde2e217934f6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Red Locomotive <67845085+redLocomotive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 10:32:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/24] multiplayer: WebSocket transport (wasm-to-wasm) over
 the enet MultiPlayer API

Browsers have no UDP, so reimplement the MultiPlayer API over emscripten/websocket.h (src/ws/multiplayer.cpp), gated by configure --enable-websocket (USE_WS_MP). mp_address.h makes ENetAddress an 8-byte POD that serialises identically across wasm clients. OGAMEMP/OGAME: fix service-button selection (painted but never detected) + pass service_mode by reference.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
